>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_tag_closed_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_markdownlint</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_checkpr</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3dd7f759b16146a08dcb8b11e5426b56&pipelineRunId=6c2df02ad69945bea4136fc92a221a3d&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/8320/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-06 17:38:13] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-06T17:38:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:38:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178769347,"discussion_id":"b02da3d6d73a968d8b492c39276000443ff53d27","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 FA MLA noquant 场景下 `multiCoreInnerIdx` 在跳过空 batch 的 `gS1` 块时仍错误递增的问题。原先 `multiCoreInnerIdx` 的递增位于 `ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1` 中（skip 检查之前），导致 `softmaxSumBuf`/`softmaxMaxBuf` 的 mod3 槽位索引与实际写入次数不一致，在 `PRELOAD_N=1` 时可能引发 vec1 覆写 vec2 未读取的 softmax 状态，最终造成 `attention_out` 计算错误。修复方式是将 `multiCoreInnerIdx++` 从 `ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1` 移至 `Process()` 中的 skip 检查（`continue`）之后，确保仅在真正执行 task 时才递增。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **将 `multiCoreInnerIdx++` 从 `ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1` 中移除**：删除了该函数中位于 `runParam.goIdx` 与 `runParam.s1oIdx` 计算之后的递增操作，避免在 skip 判断之前就错误递增索引。\n- **在 `Process()` 的 skip 检查之后添加 `multiCoreInnerIdx++`**：将递增操作置于 `s1NoNeedCalc`/`s2NoNeedCalc`/`lastBnNoNeedCalc` 等 skip 条件判断及 `continue` 语句之后，确保槽位索引仅在实际执行计算任务时才递增，与非 skip 场景保持一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T18:55:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:55:42+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178839495,"discussion_id":"3c36fa8f4105b123aad00c5b8f5c443b89c18e96","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-07-07T10:22:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T10:22:03+08:00","user":{"id":"68b518bc1e2c5615789dcedf","login":"comic97","object_id":"68b518bc1e2c5615789dcedf","name":"comic97","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/comic97"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178839515,"discussion_id":"41a2be3e1f8c1e923338d9c4ddcee07168db11ed","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*comic97*](https://gitcode.com/comic97)","created_at":"2026-07-07T10:22:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T10:22:07+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":